NAME
    gcloud beta workload-identity - manage Workload Identity

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta workload-identity GROUP [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Workload Identity.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     service-agents
        (BETA) Manage Service Agents for Workload Identity.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud workload-identity

        $ gcloud alpha workload-identity

